-- | VTDecodeFrameFlags
--
-- Directives for the decompression session and the video decoder, passed into				decodeFlags parameter of VTDecompressionSessionDecodeFrame.
--
-- kVTDecodeFrame_EnableAsynchronousDecompression
--
-- With the kVTDecodeFrame_EnableAsynchronousDecompression bit clear, the video decoder 		is compelled to emit every frame before it returns.  With the bit set, the decoder may 		process frames asynchronously, but it is not compelled to do so.
--
-- kVTDecodeFrame_DoNotOutputFrame
--
-- A hint to the decompression session and video decoder that a CVImageBuffer should not		be emitted for this frame.  NULL will be returned instead.
--
-- kVTDecodeFrame_1xRealTimePlayback
--
-- A hint to the video decoder that it would be OK to use a low-power mode that can not decode faster than 1x realtime.
--
-- kVTDecodeFrame_EnableTemporalProcessing
--
